# TASTE.md — prior rulings

Scars from real rejections. Each carries its why; a scar without a why is
a ban, and bans fossilize into style police. Read this before any design
verdict; a design decision that re-litigates a scar without new evidence
is a defect. Delete a scar the moment its expiry condition arrives.

